* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
/*
/*
/* Program ........ REH-LODX
/*
/* Function ....... Loads one or more portable files into an archive
/*                  in a NOM environment.
/*
/* Plattform ...... Linux, Unix
/*
/***********************************************************************
/*
/* Program Description:
/* ------------------------------
/* NOM administration data will be loaded into the NOM system file.
/* Report data will be compressed (blanks removed) and written to a NOM
/* archive in $EOM_ARC. Archived reports may be REVIVEd in NOM.
/*
/* Accessed DDMs: NRM-ARCHIVE-DATASET, NRM-ACTIVE-REPORTS,
/*                NRM-DATASET-REPORT, NRM-MAIL
/*
/* Needed Natural modules:
/*                R-NRMCMP(SYSNOM), NAT00083(SYSLIBS),
/*                NAT23001(SYSLIBS), NAT00081(SYSLIBS)
/*
/* Input Parameter (input once, at the start):
/*                Portable Archive Path, default = $HOME
/*                Portable Archive Name (assigned to Work File 1)
/*                Log level:  0 (least output), 1 (medium, output),
/*                  2 (most output, for every single report)
/* Input Parameters (for every archive):
/*                NOM Archive File Name located in $EOM_ARC,
/*                  default = <archive name from the source system>
/*                Confirmation flag to load archive and reports,
/*                  default = N
/*                When the symbolic variable $ADDUSER has a value
/*                  assigned, an option may be specified to add a user
/*                  to NRM-MAIL. Adding a user means to give access
/*                  rights to this user.
/*
/***********************************************************************
/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
* Maintenance:
* 2021-02-22 GGS01              Marks,where to set expiration (opt.)
* 2021-07-19 GGS02              Adapt FO-ID on target, if different
* 2021-11-08 GGS03  NOMALL-2490 BS2 H'00': avoid data loss
* 2024-03-07 SU1    ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power / SAP
* 2024-08-14 SU2    NOMALL-2694 avoid NAT1305 > 32000 AR
* 2024-08-29 BLI    NOMALL-2694 adapt FHI changes: duplicates, ET count
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
